bureaucraticSystem.config.graph will contain:
    config extraction
        general dependencies
            dependencies between required documents
            counter types and yielded document(s)
        specific conditions
            set of counters with specified number of offices per counter
            clients and their request(s)
    dependency solving
        dependency graph creation
        graph exploration/search
            suggestion: cache results, possibly immediately after graph creation => set of graphs created immediately for each type of request
                given suggestion may be innapropiate depending on second phase specs/reqs